        "created_at": "2014-08-16T03:03:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don't think it is Omnitron-X. &nbsp;The color scheme is right, but the Light Blue at the top doesn't come down far enough, and the shape of the lower half of the face doesn't lend itself to the single large central Eye and narrow defined chin of Omnitron-X.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Note that it has taken quite the beating. Also the text \"Your input has been most invaluable…\", to me that implies he has learned quite a bit from it.</p>",
